  "sn35.235:1.4": "In such contexts, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>nimitta</i> and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>anubyañjana</i> are almost always treated as parallel synonyms. The separation of the two, with the instrumental <i lang='pi' translate='no'>anubyañjanaso</i>, is found only at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn124/en/sujato#20-25.1'>MN 124:20–25.1</a> and other late texts. ",
