  "sn35.235:6.2": "A schism in the Saṅgha is regarded as a heinous crime resulting in lower rebirth. It is a legal term in the Vinaya, which requires that a group of monastics who are maliciously promulgating what is against the Dhamma and Vinaya, carry out an <i lang='pi' translate='no'>uposatha</i> procedure aiming to divide the Saṅgha. ",
